<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="as1_S2.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="as1_S2.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">AUC and FPR95 scores of full-shot OOD detection methods versus our few-shot method on the <span id="as1_S2.T6.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Synthetic</span> benchmark from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#as1_bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite>. Best/second best scores are highlighted in bold/underlined. All reference and test samples are from ShapeNet. SODA achieves the best performance in all settings.</span></figcaption>
